1
00:01:37,470 --> 00:01:42,990
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:46,020
[Episode 22]

3
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,560
What a good show.

4
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,430
I've enjoyed the show so much

5
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,610
that half my anger is gone already.

6
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,870
I never knew there could be so many

7
00:02:10,150 --> 00:02:12,950
interesting things going on
in the Xie household.

8
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:14,240
Please, go on.

9
00:02:15,150 --> 00:02:16,840
If you keep me entertained,

10
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,280
I might just let

11
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,670
what happened last night slide.

12
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,560
Since Qinghe

13
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,030
has abandoned the Xie family,

14
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,610
as far as we're concerned,

15
00:02:28,910 --> 00:02:31,960
the Xie family
has never had such a daughter.

16
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:43,030
Three feet of silk,

17
00:02:43,750 --> 00:02:45,120
a stage for a play.

18
00:02:46,079 --> 00:02:47,800
At first, you don't know

19
00:02:48,150 --> 00:02:49,680
what the play means.

20
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,970
Look again, and you're already

21
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,750
part of it.

22
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:59,030
Commander, you want to hear about
the Xie family's interesting stories.

23
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,190
But I'd say

24
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,680
the most interesting one

25
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,840
is that if you

26
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:08,280
had married Qingyuan back then,

27
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:10,320
there wouldn't be a rumor today

28
00:03:10,630 --> 00:03:13,240
about her meeting a man in secret.

29
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:17,120
Commander, why

30
00:03:17,870 --> 00:03:18,750
won't you

31
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,030
just let the Xie family go?

32
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Could it be

33
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,150
that you still have designs on Qingyuan?

34
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,590
You might as well tell us today,

35
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:31,280
so we can prepare ourselves

36
00:03:31,910 --> 00:03:32,910
and think about

37
00:03:33,590 --> 00:03:35,280
how to weather

38
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,840
the Marquis of Danyang household's

39
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,360
thunderous fury.

40
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:45,030
Grandmother,

41
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:47,710
I was the one who gave Eldest Sister

42
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:49,150
the idea to elope.

43
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:52,120
I was the one who disguised myself as her,

44
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,150
lured those people away,

45
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,880
and gave her a chance to escape.

46
00:03:55,190 --> 00:03:56,050
And I was the one

47
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,520
who accidentally

48
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:59,040
ran into the Commander.

49
00:04:01,710 --> 00:04:02,800
There's nothing

50
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:04,970
between the Commander and me.

51
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,840
But I take full responsibility

52
00:04:08,150 --> 00:04:09,710
for such an improper act

53
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,750
that brought Commander here
to question us.

54
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:13,360
I apologize to Grandmother

55
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,030
and Father,

56
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:16,160
and to Commander as well.

57
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:25,040
Why didn't I think
there was nothing between us?

58
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:31,560
Fourth Lady, how exactly did you
distinguish yourself from me?

59
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,270
Lord Xie, you certainly raised
your children well.

60
00:04:37,270 --> 00:04:42,070
The Xie family truly lives up to the saying,
"the apple doesn't fall far from the tree."

61
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:44,310
I thought

62
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:47,070
a woman as extraordinary as Fourth Lady

63
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:48,600
would be different.

64
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:50,190
But to my surprise, even as

65
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:53,520
the fiancée of the honorable Heir
to the Marquis of Danyang,

66
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,159
she could still

67
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:58,510
sneak around with another man
in the middle of the night.

68
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:01,430
Your Ladyship, your present is an honor.

69
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:04,000
Forgive us for not welcoming you properly.

70
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,170
Why are you kneeling on the ground?

71
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:12,000
It pains me to see you like this.

72
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,980
Your Ladyship,

73
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,950
what brings you here?

74
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,430
Xie Qinghe lured my nephew away.

75
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:31,380
Naturally, I'm here to demand an answer.

76
00:05:32,110 --> 00:05:34,370
Another person here to demand an answer.

77
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:37,050
Commander, since you are here too,

78
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,120
I'll have you

79
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:40,190
bear witness.

80
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,270
Now that the marriage

81
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:45,560
between our Pei family
and the Eldest Lady Xie has been called off,

82
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,960
we have no further ties
with the Xie family.

83
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,370
Your Eldest Lady left without permission

84
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:52,000
and eloped with my nephew,

85
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:54,430
tarnishing the Pei family's reputation

86
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,040
and making us
the laughingstock of Hengtang.

87
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,040
How do you

88
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,700
plan to settle this score?

89
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:03,840
Your Ladyship, that is rather one-sided.

90
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:07,210
My eldest sister and Young Master Pei
are in love.

91
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:09,560
Leaving together
was a decision of both of them.

92
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,720
How can you say that either one
lured the other?

93
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:14,040
Your Ladyship, you are absolutely right.

94
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:16,630
This is entirely the Xie family's fault.

95
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,720
My unfilial daughter
behaved disgracefully.

96
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,600
I hereby

97
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:25,720
apologize to the Founding Count's family.

98
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:30,470
I hope this will not affect
the bond between our two families.

99
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:35,510
The bond?

100
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,730
Who says we have any bond with you?

101
00:06:43,310 --> 00:06:44,800
Our Pei ancestors

102
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:47,710
helped the Grand Emperor conquer the realm

103
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:50,270
and were granted
the title of Founding Count.

104
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:53,800
Your Xie family only earned your title
because of a son who died.

105
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:57,220
How can your family
possibly compare with ours?

106
00:06:57,870 --> 00:06:58,480
You...

107
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:08,720
Well, in your opinion,

108
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:12,010
what can we do

109
00:07:12,510 --> 00:07:15,920
to let you vent your anger?

110
00:07:19,350 --> 00:07:22,010
If you want to make amends,
it's not impossible.

111
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:23,750
You took my nephew away,

112
00:07:24,250 --> 00:07:26,120
so you owe me a person in return.

113
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,800
Your Xie family seems

114
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:32,190
to have plenty of plain-looking girls.

115
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,159
This Fourth Lady is the only one

116
00:07:34,159 --> 00:07:35,560
who's pleasing to my eye.

117
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,720
Why not

118
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:39,070
give her to me as a maid?

119
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,630
Then I'll let bygones be bygones.

120
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,920
Your Ladyship, you're going too far.

121
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:52,070
Whatever wrongs Xie Qingyuan
may have done,

122
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:55,240
she is still a lady of the Xie family.

123
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:57,000
Humiliating her

124
00:07:57,630 --> 00:07:59,360
is humiliating the Xie family,

125
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:03,800
which is humiliating the Earl of Zhongyong,
whose title

126
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,620
was personally bestowed by His Majesty!

127
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:10,920
What?

128
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:14,950
You gave your daughter
to the Hu family as a concubine,

129
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:17,010
and that was perfectly respectable?

130
00:08:17,130 --> 00:08:19,310
I simply took a liking
to Fourth Lady's beauty

131
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:21,110
and wanted to take her as my maid.

132
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,830
They're both selling daughters.

133
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:24,690
How exactly am I humiliating you?

134
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,120
Absurd.

135
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:31,480
Xie Qingyuan is betrothed to
the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

136
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,390
You want her?

137
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:37,030
Have you asked the Heir?

138
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:42,320
Old Madam,

139
00:08:42,669 --> 00:08:43,669
at your age,

140
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:45,930
why are you using a junior to pressure me?

141
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:50,120
You should ask Fourth Lady this—

142
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,080
she already has a betrothal to
the Marquis of Danyang's Heir,

143
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:55,200
yet she was caught
meeting the Commander in secret.

144
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,930
What would the Marquis's household
make of that?

145
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,750
The wedding hasn't even taken place,

146
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:01,550
and the Xie family
has caused such a scandal.

147
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:02,960
I've never

148
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,420
heard of anything like it.

149
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,360
You...

150
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,630
You...

151
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:12,600
I've long heard about
Her Ladyship's sense of humor.

152
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,270
Mother,

153
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:16,120
it's indeed a well-deserved reputation.

154
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:18,270
She really knows how to joke.

155
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:25,870
Didn't the Fourth Lady just say

156
00:09:26,630 --> 00:09:28,500
that there's nothing between us?

157
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:29,960
In fact,

158
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:32,840
I'm the one with ulterior motives.

159
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:36,090
I'm the one who has feelings
for Fourth Lady.

160
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:37,870
So what exactly

161
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,360
did Fourth Lady do wrong?

162
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:46,790
Good.

163
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,000
Well said.

164
00:09:48,490 --> 00:09:50,270
What a perfect couple.

165
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:53,150
It makes me quite jealous.

166
00:09:54,910 --> 00:09:57,640
However, since my nephew Lanshan
was lured away,

167
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,930
I can hardly congratulate you two.

168
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,180
Your Ladyship.

169
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:06,240
My unfilial eldest daughter

170
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:10,200
will be brought back to you

171
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,610
as soon as possible.

172
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,960
You may do with her

173
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,910
as you please.

174
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:20,430
I'll definitely
give the Founding Count's family

175
00:10:20,630 --> 00:10:22,240
a satisfactory answer.

176
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,050
Lord Xie, I think

177
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:33,350
the Xie family's hundred acres
of fertile land

178
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:34,480
would be

179
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:37,630
a fitting answer
to the Founding Count's family.

180
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:40,520
Don't take offense.

181
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,320
As his aunt,

182
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:45,320
I have to look out for my nephew.

183
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:56,640
A pity your concern is misplaced,
Your Ladyship.

184
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,250
It goes against

185
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,970
Young Master Pei's wishes.

186
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:03,360
How can you claim to be acting
for his own good?

187
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,120
My eldest sister ran away

188
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:08,510
from her betrothal to the Hu family.

189
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:11,060
What does that have to do
with the Pei family?

190
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,480
I had no idea

191
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:19,150
that Your Ladyship's reach was this long.

192
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,720
So you think

193
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,330
you can speak for the Hu family?

194
00:11:29,270 --> 00:11:31,550
Fourth Lady,
you certainly have a silver tongue,

195
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:33,680
which makes me more interested in you.

196
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:36,810
But I wonder,
now that the Xie family has offended

197
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:40,960
both the Marquis of Danyang's household
and the Pei family over the elopement,

198
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:44,000
how will you hold your ground in Hengtang
from now on?

199
00:11:44,870 --> 00:11:48,800
Who says the Xie family has offended
the Marquis of Danyang household?

200
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:56,200
Father-in-law.

201
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,280
Grandmother.

202
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:01,370
Your Ladyship.

203
00:12:05,030 --> 00:12:05,790
Qingyuan.

204
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:13,870
Heir.

205
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:18,590
Heir, you sure are magnanimous,

206
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:21,650
willing to tolerate what others cannot.

207
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,570
I trust Qingyuan's character.

208
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:27,000
Now that she is betrothed,

209
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,080
she would never do anything

210
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:30,240
to let
the Marquis of Danyang household down.

211
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,300
So, Your Ladyship,

212
00:12:31,390 --> 00:12:34,050
please don't trouble yourself
over our family.

213
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:41,960
As for the elopement,

214
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:46,360
the Xie family will certainly apologize
to Commissioner Hu.

215
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,030
Your Ladyship,

216
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,840
If there is nothing else,

217
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:52,120
please leave.

218
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:55,840
Fine.

219
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:58,080
You're all here putting on an act
for me now.

220
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,440
here.

221
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:02,550
I wonder if you can still be as close
as a family

222
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:04,270
after I leave.

223
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,600
We will meet again.

224
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:27,840
One day,

225
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:32,330
One day, I'll have the Xie family and
the Palace Guard Division under my thumb.

226
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:36,550
Qingyuan.

227
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:42,000
I came immediately when I heard

228
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,670
something happened to the Xie family.

229
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:44,670
Seeing that you're alright

230
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:45,800
puts my mind at ease.

231
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,220
Thank you for your concern, Heir.

232
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,150
You said just

233
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,920
that Eldest Lady Xie eloped because she

234
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,960
didn't want to be forced into a marriage.

235
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,270
So, Fourth Lady,

236
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:01,360
were you also forced by the Xie family

237
00:14:01,380 --> 00:14:03,930
to marry
the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang?

238
00:14:13,550 --> 00:14:14,320
No.

239
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,200
It is what I want.

240
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,200
Commander.

241
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:28,910
It's getting late.

242
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:31,390
Now that this matter is settled,

243
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,960
and you've said that what happened
last night

244
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,890
had nothing to do with Qingyuan,

245
00:14:36,150 --> 00:14:37,480
let's leave it at that.

246
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:42,320
Old Madam, there's no need to rush me out.

247
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:44,510
Are you planning
to keep punishing Fourth Lady

248
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:46,630
after I leave to vent your anger?

249
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:47,850
I can't allow that.

250
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:53,320
Our Xie family is fair when it comes to
rewards and punishments,

251
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,450
but Qingyuan is my daughter after all.

252
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:57,720
How could I mistreat her?

253
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,390
You can rest assured.

254
00:15:01,030 --> 00:15:03,550
I already made my feelings for her clear.

255
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,570
I've made up my mind.

256
00:15:05,870 --> 00:15:08,470
Starting today,
I'll stay at the Xie Residence

257
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:15,200
to keep her safe.

258
00:15:22,870 --> 00:15:23,720
Third Madam.

259
00:15:24,150 --> 00:15:25,500
Sister Fangchun said

260
00:15:25,950 --> 00:15:27,510
that Eldest Sister and Young Master Pei

261
00:15:27,510 --> 00:15:29,310
have already crossed the river.

262
00:15:29,510 --> 00:15:30,770
Neither the Xie family

263
00:15:30,870 --> 00:15:31,940
nor the Pei family

264
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:33,700
can catch up with them now.

265
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:35,390
That's good.

266
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,000
Third Madam,

267
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,770
what are your plans for the future?

268
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,400
I'm going to stay in the temple.

269
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:45,070
I should have broken free

270
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,770
from this household cage long ago

271
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,520
and lived for myself.

272
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:53,000
Now I've finally gotten my wish.

273
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,740
You don't need to worry about me anymore.

274
00:16:04,870 --> 00:16:06,030
This thing

275
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,510
was left by your Mother.

276
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,700
I should have returned it to you long ago.

277
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,080
I...

278
00:16:15,390 --> 00:16:16,270
am sorry.

279
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,840
I think

280
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:27,790
if your Mother
could see you like this today,

281
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:29,120
smart,

282
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,240
brave,

283
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,870
and beautiful,

284
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,630
she would definitely be very happy

285
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:35,910
and proud.

286
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,510
Though I don't want you

287
00:16:43,030 --> 00:16:44,480
to be consumed by hatred,

288
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:47,650
if this is the path you've chosen,

289
00:16:48,390 --> 00:16:50,150
I'll pray for you

290
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:52,440
every day.

291
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:57,840
May the blessings I've earned

292
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,540
see you safely on your way.

293
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,600
Thank you, Third Madam.

294
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:08,480
Third Madam.

295
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,280
Take care.

296
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,440
That is because

297
00:17:57,240 --> 00:18:00,550
Xie Shu is hiding a secret
he can tell no one.

298
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,480
A monstrous secret.

299
00:18:14,550 --> 00:18:15,510
And that secret

300
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,980
lies in your mother's bronze mirror.

301
00:18:44,390 --> 00:18:46,430
[Fuyu Pavilion]

302
00:18:51,530 --> 00:18:52,140
[Qinyue Corridor]

303
00:18:54,850 --> 00:18:59,890
[Fuyu Pavilion]

304
00:18:58,440 --> 00:19:00,160
Would you really be content
marrying someone

305
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,020
you don't love?

306
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:15,350
I'd regret it even more

307
00:19:16,310 --> 00:19:18,040
if I couldn't avenge my mother.

308
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:22,790
My Lord,

309
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:26,030
I've been betrothed to the Heir
of the Marquis of Danyang.

310
00:19:26,030 --> 00:19:28,090
We shouldn't meet like this anymore.

311
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:30,510
Shen Run, you...

312
00:19:30,510 --> 00:19:31,570
Who dares to stop me

313
00:19:31,750 --> 00:19:32,950
when I want to see you?

314
00:19:33,830 --> 00:19:34,490
Put me down!

315
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,960
I want things between us to be improper.

316
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:45,960
Who can save you?

317
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:48,920
Tell me,

318
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:52,130
was everything between us in the past

319
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:53,310
a lie?

320
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:03,920
So

321
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:06,400
you never liked me?

322
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:09,960
Why are you afraid to look at me?

323
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:10,720
Look at me.

324
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,610
Answer my question.

325
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:18,140
Must I like you?

326
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:22,640
Say it again.

327
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,720
Say again that you don't like me.

328
00:20:30,110 --> 00:20:31,910
Say again that you don't like me!

329
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:39,850
You won't say it?

330
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:42,920
Then you must like me.

331
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:47,880
Even if we're destined
to take different paths,

332
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:49,740
if you're going to marry someone,

333
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,250
marry someone you love.

334
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,940
That's not necessary.

335
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:01,010
I want to take down Xie Shu,

336
00:21:02,070 --> 00:21:03,600
and you want to protect him.

337
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,760
Since we are on different paths,

338
00:21:06,030 --> 00:21:08,630
there is no need for us
to be entangled anymore.

339
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:16,330
[Fuyu Pavilion]

340
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:31,300
Commander,
I have long heard you are heartless.

341
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:33,770
I didn't expect you to have such a side.

342
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,500
What do you want to say?

343
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:39,270
I just wanted to remind you again

344
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:43,480
not to forget His Majesty's instructions
before our departure.

345
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:47,790
Not only have I not forgotten
His Majesty's instructions,

346
00:21:47,790 --> 00:21:50,000
but I also know why he gave them.

347
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:54,780
Since you know how important this is,

348
00:21:55,070 --> 00:21:56,930
you should be even more cautious.

349
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:05,680
Mother,

350
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:09,160
failing to secure the marriage
with the Hu family

351
00:22:09,160 --> 00:22:11,550
is ultimately disadvantageous for us.

352
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:24,100
[Harmony Among Kin]

353
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:20,240
At least we didn't lose

354
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:22,050
the Marquis's household.

355
00:22:22,310 --> 00:22:24,440
Even if it's the lesser of two options,

356
00:22:25,310 --> 00:22:27,640
it's still better than losing everything.

357
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:29,790
Qingyuan's wedding is coming up.

358
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:33,720
Although she helped Qinghe escape,

359
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,880
as her father,

360
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:40,510
you should know
to focus on the bigger picture

361
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:42,170
and let the smaller things go.

362
00:22:43,110 --> 00:22:45,830
Take good care of this future...

363
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:48,680
marchioness.

364
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:50,350
I understand.

365
00:22:52,830 --> 00:22:54,030
You must remember

366
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:58,270
that the family estate you manage today

367
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:03,030
is not solely your own achievement.

368
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:05,880
It is the foundation our ancestors

369
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:08,110
built for you.

370
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:09,960
In the future,

371
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:12,720
you will need your descendants

372
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:16,070
to build upon it
and make it even stronger.

373
00:23:16,590 --> 00:23:19,350
Never become so full of yourself

374
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:23,240
that you forget how you

375
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,880
made it through this day.

376
00:23:40,110 --> 00:23:41,030
Yes.

377
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:43,810
Mother, you are absolutely right.

378
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,720
We must never forget our roots.

379
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:47,750
I will never forget

380
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:51,310
how you raised me
and cared for me from childhood.

381
00:23:52,030 --> 00:23:53,240
Even now,

382
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:55,920
in the Xie family,

383
00:23:56,350 --> 00:23:57,960
you are still the pillar.

384
00:24:02,110 --> 00:24:03,350
That is why

385
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:05,750
I often feel ashamed.

386
00:24:07,270 --> 00:24:10,830
Ever since you entrusted
the family seal to me back then,

387
00:24:11,310 --> 00:24:12,750
you've still

388
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,790
been carrying much of the burden

389
00:24:14,790 --> 00:24:17,960
of this family on your shoulders.

390
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:20,440
I've truly fallen short.

391
00:24:22,590 --> 00:24:23,720
I will definitely

392
00:24:24,830 --> 00:24:26,750
work twice as hard

393
00:24:27,110 --> 00:24:29,110
and strive to shoulder

394
00:24:29,110 --> 00:24:31,400
the Xie family entirely myself
as soon as I can,

395
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:33,370
so you can enjoy a peaceful life

396
00:24:34,070 --> 00:24:36,730
and spend your twilight years
in comfort early.

397
00:24:55,900 --> 00:24:58,350
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

398
00:25:06,550 --> 00:25:08,210
Have things been taken care of

399
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:10,720
with Hu Wenzhuo?

400
00:25:12,030 --> 00:25:14,550
If she really brings Commissioner Hu here,

401
00:25:15,310 --> 00:25:16,850
putting aside whether

402
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,110
he'll cause trouble for you,

403
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:21,590
Shen Run alone

404
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:24,560
will be hard to deal with.

405
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:28,120
Don't worry, Mother.

406
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:31,310
I have written a letter overnight,

407
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:34,960
detailing the situation in Hengtang.

408
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,240
Rest assured.

409
00:25:38,350 --> 00:25:39,240
Master!

410
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,110
Old Madam!

411
00:25:39,590 --> 00:25:41,110
[Harmony Among Kin]

412
00:25:41,150 --> 00:25:43,240
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

413
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,370
Commissioner Hu

414
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,240
is arriving.

415
00:26:20,510 --> 00:26:21,310
Dear,

416
00:26:23,070 --> 00:26:24,510
have some pastries.

417
00:26:25,270 --> 00:26:26,730
I made them for you myself.

418
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:37,960
What kind of pastries
could possibly be worth

419
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:40,830
the trouble of bringing them
to me yourself?

420
00:26:43,070 --> 00:26:44,130
Let me take a guess.

421
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:47,070
My brother

422
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:49,400
is coming.

423
00:26:52,790 --> 00:26:55,200
Lord Hu Xing is here,

424
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:59,270
and Xie Shu is scared.

425
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:15,750
Dear,

426
00:27:16,830 --> 00:27:18,440
that's not fair.

427
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:20,590
Do you have any idea

428
00:27:22,030 --> 00:27:23,030
how much trouble

429
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:27,880
I've gone through for your sake?

430
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:29,940
Do you know how much

431
00:27:30,750 --> 00:27:33,350
it pains me to see you like this?

432
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,270
Go.

433
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,720
Bring me the new clothes

434
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:52,510
I just had made.

435
00:27:58,790 --> 00:27:59,480
Mother,

436
00:27:59,830 --> 00:28:00,690
are you sleepy?

437
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:01,960
I'm not sleepy.

438
00:28:03,550 --> 00:28:04,830
I'm so sleepy.

439
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:13,240
Mother,

440
00:28:13,570 --> 00:28:14,790
when do you think

441
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,270
Uncle will arrive?

442
00:28:20,030 --> 00:28:20,920
Mother!

443
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:28,880
I fell asleep.

444
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:31,730
I'm getting old. I'm not much use anymore.

445
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,830
I'll go back and rest.

446
00:28:35,070 --> 00:28:36,800
When Commissioner Hu arrives,

447
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:38,590
apologize to him for me.

448
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:48,160
Father, Mother,

449
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:50,360
I'll take Grandmother back to rest now.

450
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:57,820
You should also get some rest.

451
00:29:18,030 --> 00:29:19,830
My brother's visiting this time

452
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:23,240
has brought back so many memories.

453
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:30,160
Where was it that we first met?

454
00:29:30,830 --> 00:29:32,560
At the Chrysanthemum Festival

455
00:29:33,070 --> 00:29:34,270
in Hengtang.

456
00:29:40,110 --> 00:29:41,270
That day,

457
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:44,400
you were dressed in green.

458
00:29:45,830 --> 00:29:47,200
You hardly spoke,

459
00:29:47,750 --> 00:29:50,400
but your pride couldn't be hidden.

460
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:53,160
Many people thought you were dull

461
00:29:53,750 --> 00:29:54,640
and aloof,

462
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,440
but I thought

463
00:30:00,550 --> 00:30:03,750
you were completely different
from those young noblemen

464
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,210
who fawned over my brother.

465
00:30:19,510 --> 00:30:21,160
I was foolish enough

466
00:30:22,310 --> 00:30:25,720
to believe in that noble, unyielding facade
of yours.

467
00:30:27,050 --> 00:30:29,090
I've never lied to you.

468
00:30:39,350 --> 00:30:41,610
Enough about these meaningless things.

469
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,750
Between you and me

470
00:30:43,070 --> 00:30:44,930
lie the lives of our two children.

471
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:48,200
No affection can make up
for this blood debt.

472
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,160
Besides,

473
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:55,940
have you ever loved me?

474
00:30:58,750 --> 00:31:00,720
What are you trying to say?

475
00:31:15,270 --> 00:31:18,470
The humiliation
I suffered in the Xie family for decades—

476
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,510
I'll let it go.

477
00:31:21,550 --> 00:31:23,160
But my last concern

478
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:26,640
is the marriages of Qingrong and Qingru.

479
00:31:27,110 --> 00:31:28,880
If they make good marriages,

480
00:31:29,640 --> 00:31:31,200
I'll let everything go.

481
00:31:31,550 --> 00:31:34,070
But if you can't even do that,

482
00:31:58,680 --> 00:32:00,160
I'll have my brother

483
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:03,070
wipe out the Xie family,

484
00:32:06,270 --> 00:32:07,770
leaving no one spared.

485
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:48,640
Looks like

486
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:52,270
your brother-in-law isn't coming.

487
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:54,350
What a pity.

488
00:32:54,790 --> 00:32:55,550
Yes.

489
00:32:56,890 --> 00:32:57,880
What a pity.

490
00:32:58,830 --> 00:33:00,110
I thought

491
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:02,500
I'd finally get to meet Commissioner Hu.

492
00:33:05,270 --> 00:33:06,960
On my way here,

493
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:09,750
I suddenly remembered

494
00:33:10,550 --> 00:33:13,720
that when I was little,
I once called you "Uncle"

495
00:33:14,310 --> 00:33:17,970
and witnessed the friendship
between you and my father back then.

496
00:33:18,030 --> 00:33:22,690
I also know that you once traveled
to the capital together to take the imperial exam,

497
00:33:22,790 --> 00:33:24,880
sharing the same lofty ambitions.

498
00:33:26,790 --> 00:33:28,350
How could you

499
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:30,440
forget the old days?

500
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:32,110
Back then,

501
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,400
your father and I

502
00:33:35,310 --> 00:33:38,070
made a solemn vow together.

503
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:39,830
I, Shen Zhibai.

504
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:41,070
And I, Xie Shu.

505
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:43,640
We hereby swear to become sworn brothers.

506
00:33:43,640 --> 00:33:45,590
We weren't born on the same day,

507
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:48,550
but we ask to die on the same day.

508
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:50,350
Before Lord Guan,

509
00:33:50,350 --> 00:33:52,600
we make this oath.

510
00:33:52,620 --> 00:33:53,510
Should either of us break it,

511
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:55,110
may Heaven strike us down!

512
00:34:01,310 --> 00:34:02,240
Brother.

513
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,240
Brother.

514
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:07,800
Even if I have to die
a thousand deaths in this life,

515
00:34:08,510 --> 00:34:10,480
I will never forget it.

516
00:34:11,710 --> 00:34:13,190
For the past 9 years,

517
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:16,400
I've never understood

518
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:20,030
what interest could have driven
everyone here

519
00:34:21,760 --> 00:34:23,760
to jointly frame

520
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:26,070
a good official,

521
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:27,400
accusing him

522
00:34:27,550 --> 00:34:29,150
of pocketing the coal supplies

523
00:34:29,150 --> 00:34:30,880
and delaying disaster relief,

524
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:34,100
which led to dozens of people
freezing to death.

525
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:36,480
What was really going on?

526
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:40,920
And where did the money go that they

527
00:34:41,150 --> 00:34:43,010
accused my father of embezzling?

528
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:48,670
It wasn't until I came to Hengtang

529
00:34:50,190 --> 00:34:52,880
that I started hearing
so much about that lord.

530
00:34:53,550 --> 00:34:56,590
Lord Xie, you refused
to tell me who he was.

531
00:34:57,030 --> 00:34:59,160
And those criminals who were tortured

532
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:01,440
and sentenced to death

533
00:35:02,070 --> 00:35:04,320
also refused to tell me who he was.

534
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:08,920
It wasn't until you hastily arranged
to marry off your daughters

535
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,800
that I suddenly understood.

536
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:15,960
The man you've been desperately trying to win over,

537
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:18,030
the man you've been currying favor with,

538
00:35:18,030 --> 00:35:19,880
was that lord behind it all—

539
00:35:21,190 --> 00:35:22,760
your brother-in-law,

540
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:27,140
Hu Xing, who now holds the position of Commissioner

541
00:35:28,150 --> 00:35:29,150
at court.

542
00:35:32,510 --> 00:35:33,590
The coal case

543
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:36,110
back then

544
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:39,960
had nothing to do with me.

545
00:35:40,510 --> 00:35:43,640
I know nothing

546
00:35:44,110 --> 00:35:46,170
about the lord you're talking about.

547
00:35:46,550 --> 00:35:47,630
If it really

548
00:35:49,110 --> 00:35:50,840
was Lord Hu,

549
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:56,230
then at most, it was merely...

550
00:35:57,150 --> 00:35:58,280
a coincidence.

551
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:03,360
Then is it also a coincidence
that His Majesty ordered me

552
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:06,110
to protect you at all costs?

553
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:08,630
I suppose it is.

554
00:36:10,710 --> 00:36:12,110
What else could it be?

555
00:36:15,190 --> 00:36:16,280
Run,

556
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:18,400
I just have one thing

557
00:36:18,710 --> 00:36:20,170
I don't quite understand.

558
00:36:20,710 --> 00:36:22,110
Regarding this coal case

559
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:24,480
involving your late father,

560
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:28,260
His Majesty has already investigated it thoroughly back then

561
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:31,000
and cleared your family's name.

562
00:36:32,150 --> 00:36:33,800
Why reopen it now?

563
00:36:34,840 --> 00:36:36,190
The officialdom

564
00:36:37,710 --> 00:36:39,590
is like this bowl of tea.

565
00:36:40,440 --> 00:36:42,500
Once the person who poured it leaves,

566
00:36:42,710 --> 00:36:44,480
it quickly goes cold.

567
00:36:45,230 --> 00:36:47,320
But if you insist on jumping in,

568
00:36:47,630 --> 00:36:51,960
it can become as dangerous as the sea.

569
00:36:53,150 --> 00:36:56,760
You should get out while you can.

570
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:07,360
Lord Xie, you're a smart man.

571
00:37:08,360 --> 00:37:10,360
You must already know who His Majesty

572
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:12,010
is targeting.

573
00:37:12,710 --> 00:37:14,630
A royal command cannot be disobeyed.

574
00:37:14,630 --> 00:37:17,360
I'm putting aside my family feud to work with you.

575
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:20,870
I only hope you truly haven't forgotten

576
00:37:22,070 --> 00:37:23,480
the vow you made.

577
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:26,070
Brother,

578
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:27,920
as long as the two of us

579
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:30,050
stand united and work wholeheartedly

580
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:31,990
for the court and for the people,

581
00:37:32,150 --> 00:37:34,840
we'll make those corrupt officials in Hengtang

582
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:37,300
spit out every last tael they've embezzled.

583
00:37:38,590 --> 00:37:39,630
I won't forget.

584
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:43,760
There are two things

585
00:37:44,920 --> 00:37:46,280
I will never forget

586
00:37:47,230 --> 00:37:48,110
in this life.

587
00:37:49,190 --> 00:37:50,070
First,

588
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:53,320
His Majesty's grace.

589
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:55,840
Second,

590
00:37:58,400 --> 00:37:59,670
your father,

591
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:03,950
my good brother who now rests in heaven,

592
00:38:04,670 --> 00:38:05,880
Lord Shen.

593
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,040
Officer,

594
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:12,810
you just arrived here,

595
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:15,150
so I'm afraid you don't know how things work around here.

596
00:38:15,150 --> 00:38:16,010
Think about it.

597
00:38:16,320 --> 00:38:17,570
Whose ship

598
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:19,000
did you detain today?

599
00:38:19,400 --> 00:38:20,070
And whose cargo

600
00:38:20,070 --> 00:38:21,300
did you confiscate?

601
00:38:21,710 --> 00:38:24,110
Since the ancestors' time, the water transport in Hengtang

602
00:38:24,110 --> 00:38:25,670
has been under the Pei family's control.

603
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:27,670
Not even the Emperor of Heaven himself

604
00:38:27,670 --> 00:38:29,840
could interfere with this waterway.

605
00:38:30,070 --> 00:38:32,400
I don't care whose rules apply here,

606
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,890
nor do I care whose ship it is.

607
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:36,280
Today,

608
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:38,280
none of you is leaving the shore.

609
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:39,110
I said so.

610
00:38:39,670 --> 00:38:40,550
I...

611
00:38:41,070 --> 00:38:42,000
am the rule.

612
00:38:43,150 --> 00:38:45,280
I'm kindly reminding you.

613
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:47,150
The water transport belongs to the Pei family,

614
00:38:47,150 --> 00:38:49,030
the Founding Count's family.

615
00:38:49,190 --> 00:38:51,320
Behind them is Commissioner Hu from the capital.

616
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:53,400
You'd better think this through carefully.

617
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:55,670
If you insist on stepping into

618
00:38:56,000 --> 00:38:57,230
this den of death,

619
00:38:58,510 --> 00:39:00,960
I'm afraid you might not even have a body left intact.

620
00:39:00,960 --> 00:39:03,290
By then, you can blame no one but yourself!

621
00:39:39,150 --> 00:39:39,800
Stop!

622
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:50,360
So it's you, Commander.

623
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,460
My subordinates are ignorant.

624
00:39:57,460 --> 00:39:59,980
I hope you'll be gracious enough to let it go

625
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:02,120
and not let them spoil your mood.

626
00:40:04,590 --> 00:40:05,400
Stop yelling!

627
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:09,500
If the Commander had made a move, you'd be dead already!

628
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:16,500
Hurry up and thank the Commander
for sparing your life!

629
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,440
Thank you, Commander,

630
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,570
for sparing my life.

631
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:25,030
Thank you, Commander,

632
00:40:25,030 --> 00:40:26,400
for sparing our lives!

633
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:36,240
Fan Zhong,

634
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:37,400
take them away.

635
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,000
Inventory the cargo,

636
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:40,670
seal the ship, and check the books.

637
00:40:40,670 --> 00:40:41,110
Yes.

638
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:45,030
For our wedding, my mother

639
00:40:45,670 --> 00:40:46,400
hired craftsmen

640
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:49,190
to make new furniture for our bridal chamber from golden-thread nanmu.

641
00:40:49,190 --> 00:40:50,360
My father also asked a friend

642
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:53,490
to bring dozens of bolts of fine Yun brocade from Suzhou.

643
00:40:53,960 --> 00:40:54,560
Oh, right.

644
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:56,440
My mother keeps urging me

645
00:40:56,440 --> 00:40:57,710
to decide on the design of the wedding clothes,

646
00:40:57,710 --> 00:40:59,960
but I thought it's better to let you decide.

647
00:40:59,960 --> 00:41:02,160
I will follow your arrangements, Heir.

648
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:05,480
Qingyuan,

649
00:41:07,760 --> 00:41:09,820
I know you don't have feelings for me,

650
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:11,760
but I believe

651
00:41:12,710 --> 00:41:13,670
that one day,

652
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:14,920
you will.

653
00:41:15,630 --> 00:41:16,510
I only hope

654
00:41:17,150 --> 00:41:18,710
that you're not forcing yourself

655
00:41:18,710 --> 00:41:19,970
to make this decision.

656
00:41:23,680 --> 00:41:30,530
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

657
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:28,650
I'm not forcing myself.

658
00:41:29,590 --> 00:41:31,030
Given my background,

659
00:41:30,560 --> 00:41:37,180
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

660
00:41:31,630 --> 00:41:33,030
having you favor me

661
00:41:33,190 --> 00:41:34,360
is my blessing.

662
00:41:37,030 --> 00:41:38,190
I often feel

663
00:41:37,280 --> 00:41:44,920
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

664
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:40,820
that you're like a piece of cold jade.

665
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:43,590
No matter how long I hold you against my body to warm you,

666
00:41:43,590 --> 00:41:44,710
all that ever warms up

667
00:41:44,710 --> 00:41:45,880
is my own body heat.

668
00:41:45,040 --> 00:41:52,340
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

669
00:41:46,510 --> 00:41:47,480
So once I let go,

670
00:41:49,110 --> 00:41:52,110
you'll be cold again, as if no one has ever touched you.

671
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:59,410
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

672
00:41:56,230 --> 00:41:57,360
But that's alright.

673
00:41:57,630 --> 00:41:58,360
I the future,

674
00:41:58,760 --> 00:41:59,760
I'll always protect you

675
00:41:59,510 --> 00:42:09,690
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

676
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:01,360
and keep you warm.

677
00:42:04,710 --> 00:42:06,510
Since we're on different paths,

678
00:42:06,630 --> 00:42:07,830
I won't work with you.

679
00:42:09,870 --> 00:42:17,050
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

680
00:42:17,070 --> 00:42:24,240
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

681
00:42:18,710 --> 00:42:19,510
What's wrong?

682
00:42:21,710 --> 00:42:22,480
Nothing.

683
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:24,880
Just lost a little trinket.

684
00:42:24,270 --> 00:42:27,850
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

685
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:26,840
Some things

686
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:28,630
are always with you,

687
00:42:27,870 --> 00:42:31,490
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

688
00:42:29,510 --> 00:42:31,520
so you start to think they'll always be there.

689
00:42:31,520 --> 00:42:37,930
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

690
00:42:42,320 --> 00:42:43,000
Qingyuan.

691
00:42:44,510 --> 00:42:45,510
Whoever hurts you

692
00:42:45,670 --> 00:42:46,760
is my enemy.

693
00:42:47,230 --> 00:42:48,960
You want to avenge your mother.

694
00:42:49,550 --> 00:42:50,810
And I'll do it with you.

695
00:42:53,030 --> 00:42:54,030
Can you tell me

696
00:42:53,220 --> 00:42:59,690
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

697
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:55,670
who it is?

698
00:42:59,800 --> 00:43:06,960
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

699
00:43:00,150 --> 00:43:00,920
Heir,

700
00:43:01,550 --> 00:43:03,080
if you truly want to help me,

701
00:43:03,960 --> 00:43:04,710
I'll tell you

702
00:43:05,230 --> 00:43:06,480
someday.

703
00:43:07,140 --> 00:43:14,500
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

704
00:43:08,510 --> 00:43:09,320
Alright.

705
00:43:13,710 --> 00:43:15,590
We're getting married soon.

706
00:43:14,610 --> 00:43:21,780
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

707
00:43:16,230 --> 00:43:17,800
Qingyuan, can you

708
00:43:18,360 --> 00:43:19,510
call me Chunzhi?

709
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:29,180
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

710
00:43:22,030 --> 00:43:23,000
Chunzhi.

711
00:43:29,310 --> 00:43:36,120
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

712
00:43:30,230 --> 00:43:31,000
Don't worry.

713
00:43:31,840 --> 00:43:33,570
Since I've agreed to marry you,

714
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:35,480
I'll be a good wife to you.

715
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:37,630
Alright!

716
00:43:38,670 --> 00:43:39,200
Let's go.

717
00:43:39,510 --> 00:43:40,440
Let's go buy the Eastern Pearls.
